      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Subterranean Sunken Ruins</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Black markets, hidden refuges, ancient artifacts.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Criminal syndicates, rogue zombies, toxic cave-ins, stone guardians.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p>The Final Guard: Kalenius's mausoleum is permanently guarded by the Final Guard—one thousand elite ancient Thurian warriors transformed into deathless, animate stone.</p>\n<p>4.2 Interior Fiefs & Agricultural Heartland</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Criminal syndicates, rogue zombies, toxic cave-ins, stone guardians.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>The Underworld Dens: The Cistern of the Blind Saint</h3>\n<p>Deep beneath the ruined sunken palaces of The Pit, beyond the patrols of <a href=\"#factions/republican-insurgents\" class=\"wiki-link\">Republican Insurgents</a> and the zombie containment pits, lies the secret heart of Kordova's criminal empire: <strong>The Cistern of the Blind Saint</strong>. A colossal pre-Cataclysmic reservoir carved from black granite during Period II, this subterranean vault serves as the headquarters of <a href=\"#factions/kordovan-thieves-guild\" class=\"wiki-link\">The Night Guild of Kordova</a>. From an elevated dais above the dark waters, <a href=\"#npcs/beltran-desoto\" class=\"wiki-link\">Guildmaster Don Beltrán de Soto</a> administers <em>El Pundonor del Arroyo</em>, adjudicating criminal disputes, storing fenced silver, and coordinating defenses against <a href=\"#factions/velasco-thieves-guild\" class=\"wiki-link\">Velascan cutthroats</a> seeking to infiltrate the depths.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The University Scriptorium Outfall:</strong> Directly above the northern rim of The Pit loom the crumbling foundations of <a href=\"#gazetteer/royal-university-of-kordava\" class=\"wiki-link\">The Royal University of Kordava</a>. Flooded drainage conduits and ancient elven cisterns beneath the Sunken Scriptorium descend straight into the upper levels of The Pit, providing a covert smuggling conduit utilized by <a href=\"#npcs/eusebio-falcon\" class=\"wiki-link\">Maestro Eusebio</a> and underworld scavengers from the <a href=\"#factions/kordovan-thieves-guild\" class=\"wiki-link\">Night Guild</a>.</p>\n",
