      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Involved Factions:</strong> Vesper the Key-Master, Grandee Coalitions, The Triumvirate</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic Reward:</strong> Secures pre-Cataclysmic weaponry and stone-guardian armor from the Final Guard, allowing the PCs to equip an elite personal household guard immune to corruption.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>Narrative Premise</h3>\n<p>Vesper approaches the PCs through a secret passage in the palace wine cellar, offering a map to the forgotten crypt of King Kalenius beneath Kordava's harbor in exchange for royal immunity for his smuggling guild.</p>\n\n<h3>Core Conflict &amp; Player Choice</h3>\n<p>The crypt contains legendary pre-Cataclysmic weapons and the dormant Final Guard (one thousand animate stone warriors), but entering requires diving into flooded tunnels infested with aquatic ghoul constructs.</p>\n\n<div class=\"dc-box\">\n  <strong>Basic D&D Challenge Checks:</strong> Constitution check to swim flooded crypts; Fighter attack rolls and tactical retreat vs. stone guardians..\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"escalation\"><strong>Dynamic Escalation Trigger:</strong> Disturbing the crypt without the proper ritual key awakens six stone guardians who attack relentlessly until subdued or sealed back behind the stone gate.</p>\n",
