      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Involved Factions:</strong> Restoration Council, Vesper the Key-Master, The Triumvirate</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic Reward:</strong> Reclaims hoarded state gold from Council vaults, allowing the PCs to pay the Kordava city watch directly and secure their absolute loyalty.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>Narrative Premise</h3>\n<p>The PCs partner with Vesper the Key-Master to break into the Restoration Council's secret subterranean vaults beneath Kordava to seize hoarded bullion.</p>\n\n<h3>Core Conflict &amp; Player Choice</h3>\n<p>Bypass pre-Cataclysmic mechanical wards, avoid Council patrols, and extract hoarded gold without being identified.</p>\n\n<div class=\"dc-box\">\n  <strong>Basic D&D Challenge Checks:</strong> Thief Open Locks / Find Traps check (or Dexterity check); Intelligence check to bypass ancient mechanical wards..\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"escalation\"><strong>Dynamic Escalation Trigger:</strong> Triggering a trap fills the vault with paralytic gas and summons mute thrall sentinels.</p>\n",
