        "publicStance": "Officially dead in royal genealogies; formerly a minor noble of House Soto stripped of lands during the Period VII Restoration Civil War.",
        "secretAgenda": "Beltrán is terrified that the violent Velasco Syndicate will assassinate his lieutenants and seize the docks, but his pride forbids him from showing weakness. Furthermore, he possesses an ancient brass key that unlocks the Subterranean Water-Gate beneath the High Alcázar—a secret he has withheld even from Sadoria.",
